OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening 
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear periods.        
OL,7,FClouding over at times across Lothian, 
OL,8,FEdinburgh and Borders with a few light 
OL,9,Fshowers. Dry with patchy frost         
OL,10,Felsewhere. Freshening breeze in the    
OL,11,Fwest will add to the cold feel.        
OL,13,CSunday:FDry with variable amounts of   
OL,14,Fcloud and some sunny intervals. Fresh  
OL,15,Fto strong east or southeasterly winds  
OL,16,Falong the Solway coast.                
OL,18,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry   
OL,19,Fand bright on Monday. Chance of rain   
OL,20,Fat times on Tuesday and Wednesday.     
OL,21,FFresh southeasterly wind.              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
